# =====================================================================================================
# WHITELIST .gitignore — everything is ignored unless it is explicitly allowed below.
# Goal: the private Git repository holds code, frozen protocols and derived results only.
# NEVER in Git (private or public): the manuscript, reviews/editorial notes, submission strategy,
# comparisons with other own manuscripts, unpublished theory notes, literature PDFs, raw data.
# Those stay local (and in an encrypted backup), see PRIVATE_FILES.md.
# =====================================================================================================

# 1) ignore everything at the top level ...
/*
# 2) ... except these
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/REPRODUCE_FINITE_CAP.md
!/PRIVATE_FILES.md
!/requirements_finite_cap.txt
!/requirements_lock_2026-11-16.txt
!/REPRODUCE.md
!/MANIFEST.csv
!/Makefile
!/pyproject.toml
!/src/
!/tests/
!/tools/
!/experiments/
!/testbed/
!/results/
!/docs/

# 3) excluded inside allowed folders
/testbed/out/
/testbed/*.tgz
/results/r1_audit.log
/results/**/*.pkl
/tools/git_*.sh.bak

# docs: unpublished theory, review/editorial/submission material, own-manuscript comparisons, literature
/docs/audit/
/docs/lit/
/docs/theory/
/docs/pdfs/
/docs/AI_USE_DISCLOSURE_DRAFT.md
/docs/CLAIM_TO_EVIDENCE_AUDIT.csv
/docs/DECISION_*.md
/docs/EDITORIAL_*.md
/docs/EXTERNAL_THEOREM_REVIEW_PACKET.md
/docs/FORMAL_*.md
/docs/IF_READINESS_GATE*.md
/docs/MATHEMATICAL_VERIFICATION_REPORT.md
/docs/NOVELTY_AUDIT*.md
/docs/novelty-audit.md
/docs/PRIOR_ART_*.md
/docs/PRIORITY_AND_STATUS_MATRIX*.md
/docs/REVIEW_RESPONSE*.md
/docs/SUBMISSION_GATE*.md
/docs/THEOREM_VERIFICATION.md
/docs/THEORY_CHANNEL_REGIMES.md
/docs/overlap-and-salami-guard.md
/docs/similarity_*.txt
/docs/flight-protocol.md.sha256.bak
/docs/SPRINT_*.md
/docs/FINAL_ARCHIVE_MANIFEST*.txt
/docs/FEASIBILITY_EXTERNAL_DATA_*.md
/docs/RESEARCH_PLAN.md
/docs/ASSESSMENT_*.md

# 4) never anywhere
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
*.tex
*.bib
*.pdf
*.docx
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
